      "source_page_number": null,
      "source_image_index": null,
      "ownership": "unknown"
    },
    "parts": [],
    "answer_text": "Sources of long-term finance are: Equity shares, Retained earnings, Preference shares, Debentures, Loans from financial institutions, Loan from Banks. Sources of short-term finance are: Trade credit, Factoring, Banks, Commercial paper.",
